# --- Private training data -------------------------------------------------
# The system is published; an individual's training record is NOT. The real
# memory files are kept out of version control. Only the *.template.* files and
# the *.example.* files are tracked. If you adopt this system, your own data
# below stays local by default.
memory/sessions.jsonl
memory/archive.jsonl
memory/current_state.md
memory/swimmer_profile.md
memory/prs.json
memory/phase.json
memory/TRAINING_LOG.md

# Explicitly keep the templates and the synthetic examples tracked.
!memory/*.template.md
!memory/*.template.json
!memory/*.example.jsonl

# --- OS / editor cruft -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Local Claude Code state ----------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
